---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<!-- ===== THE OPPORTUNITY - WHY SPONSOR ===== -->
<section id="opportunity" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle gold glow -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-gold/8 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    <p class="text-gold font-display italic text-lg mb-3 text-center" data-lang-en="The Opportunity" data-lang-fr="L'opportunité">The Opportunity</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 text-center font-display" data-lang-en="Why Partner With Team Canada" data-lang-fr="Pourquoi devenir partenaire">Why Partner With Team Canada</h2>
    <p class="text-muted text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14 text-center" data-lang-en="Canada has been off the world's biggest culinary stage for ten years. Sponsoring this comeback puts your brand at the centre of one of the most compelling stories in Canadian food, with visibility from Montréal's training kitchens to the competition floor in Lyon." data-lang-fr="Le Canada est absent de la plus grande scène culinaire mondiale depuis dix ans. Commanditer ce retour place votre marque au cœur de l'une des plus belles histoires de la gastronomie canadienne, avec une visibilité des cuisines d'entraînement de Montréal jusqu'au parquet de compétition à Lyon.">Canada has been off the world's biggest culinary stage for ten years. Sponsoring this comeback puts your brand at the centre of one of the most compelling stories in Canadian food, with visibility from Montréal's training kitchens to the competition floor in Lyon.</p>

    <!-- Value Props -->
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 md:gap-6 mb-14">
      <div class="border border-gold/15 bg-cream/95 hover:border-gold/40 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gold/10 transition-all duration-300 rounded-lg p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-gold/40 bg-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-gold"><Icon name="trophy" /></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-ink mb-2" data-lang-en="World-Stage Visibility" data-lang-fr="Visibilité sur la scène mondiale">World-Stage Visibility</h3>
        <p class="text-body-alt text-sm leading-relaxed" data-lang-en="Sirha Lyon is the hospitality industry's global meeting point: 200,000+ professionals from 100+ countries, alongside the Bocuse d'Or. Your logo is there." data-lang-fr="Le Sirha Lyon est le rendez-vous mondial de l'hôtellerie-restauration : plus de 200 000 professionnels venus de plus de 100 pays, aux côtés du Bocuse d'Or. Votre logo y sera.">Sirha Lyon is the hospitality industry's global meeting point: 200,000+ professionals from 100+ countries, alongside the Bocuse d'Or. Your logo is there.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-gold/15 bg-cream/95 hover:border-gold/40 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gold/10 transition-all duration-300 rounded-lg p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-gold/40 bg-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-gold"><Icon name="maple" /></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-ink mb-2" data-lang-en="Canadian Pride" data-lang-fr="Fierté canadienne">Canadian Pride</h3>
        <p class="text-body-alt text-sm leading-relaxed" data-lang-en="Team Canada. The maple leaf. Bar George in Montréal. Associate your brand with the best of Canadian culinary talent, and a comeback story the whole country will follow." data-lang-fr="Équipe Canada. La feuille d'érable. Le Bar George à Montréal. Associez votre marque au meilleur du talent culinaire canadien, et à un retour que tout le pays suivra.">Team Canada. The maple leaf. Bar George in Montréal. Associate your brand with the best of Canadian culinary talent, and a comeback story the whole country will follow.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-gold/15 bg-cream/95 hover:border-gold/40 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gold/10 transition-all duration-300 rounded-lg p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-gold/40 bg-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-gold"><Icon name="megaphone" /></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-ink mb-2" data-lang-en="Content That Works" data-lang-fr="Un contenu qui travaille pour vous">Content That Works</h3>
        <p class="text-body-alt text-sm leading-relaxed" data-lang-en="Chef-led stories, behind-the-scenes training content, live competition coverage: authentic media your marketing team can't create alone." data-lang-fr="Histoires racontées par les chefs, contenus d'entraînement en coulisses, couverture en direct de la compétition : un contenu authentique que votre équipe marketing ne peut pas créer seule.">Chef-led stories, behind-the-scenes training content, live competition coverage: authentic media your marketing team can't create alone.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-gold/15 bg-cream/95 hover:border-gold/40 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gold/10 transition-all duration-300 rounded-lg p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-gold/40 bg-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-gold"><Icon name="tag" /></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-ink mb-2" data-lang-en="Category Exclusivity" data-lang-fr="Exclusivité de catégorie">Category Exclusivity</h3>
        <p class="text-body-alt text-sm leading-relaxed" data-lang-en="Own your space. Lead, Premier and Official partners lock exclusive placement in their industry for the full campaign." data-lang-fr="Votre espace, à vous. Les partenaires majeurs, Premier et officiels verrouillent un placement exclusif dans leur secteur pour toute la campagne.">Own your space. Lead, Premier and Official partners lock exclusive placement in their industry for the full campaign.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-gold/15 bg-cream/95 hover:border-gold/40 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gold/10 transition-all duration-300 rounded-lg p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-gold/40 bg-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-gold"><Icon name="jacket" /></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-ink mb-2" data-lang-en="Logo Where It Matters" data-lang-fr="Votre logo là où ça compte">Logo Where It Matters</h3>
        <p class="text-body-alt text-sm leading-relaxed" data-lang-en="Chef jackets, team apparel, campaign materials and the sponsor wall, seen by guests, media and industry leaders for 12+ months." data-lang-fr="Vestes de chef, tenues d'équipe, supports de campagne et mur des commanditaires, vus par les invités, les médias et les leaders de l'industrie pendant plus de 12 mois.">Chef jackets, team apparel, campaign materials and the sponsor wall, seen by guests, media and industry leaders for 12+ months.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-gold/15 bg-cream/95 hover:border-gold/40 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gold/10 transition-all duration-300 rounded-lg p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-gold/40 bg-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-gold"><Icon name="flame" /></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-ink mb-2" data-lang-en="Limited Slots" data-lang-fr="Places limitées">Limited Slots</h3>
        <p class="text-body-alt text-sm leading-relaxed" data-lang-en="Only 8 flagship slots: 2 Lead, 3 Premier, 3 Official, all currently open. The first partner to fill each tier is recognized as a Founding Partner of the 2027 campaign. When they're gone, the next International Catering Cup is in 2029." data-lang-fr="Seulement 8 places phares : 2 majeures, 3 Premier, 3 officielles, toutes actuellement disponibles. Le premier partenaire à occuper chaque niveau est reconnu comme partenaire fondateur de la campagne 2027. Quand elles seront prises, la prochaine International Catering Cup aura lieu en 2029.">Only 8 flagship slots: 2 Lead, 3 Premier, 3 Official, all currently open. The first partner to fill each tier is recognized as a Founding Partner of the 2027 campaign. When they're gone, the next International Catering Cup is in 2029.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sponsorship CTA -->
    <div id="sponsor-cta" class="border-run border border-gold/25 bg-cream rounded-lg p-8 md:p-12 text-center">
      <p class="text-gold-dark font-display italic text-lg mb-3" data-lang-en="Sponsorship" data-lang-fr="Partenariat">Sponsorship</p>
      <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-display mb-4 text-ink" data-lang-en="Your Brand, On the World Stage" data-lang-fr="Votre marque, sur la scène mondiale">Your Brand, On the World Stage</h3>
      <p class="text-body-alt text-lg mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" data-lang-en="Join the partners powering Canada's return to the International Catering Cup in Lyon." data-lang-fr="Rejoignez les partenaires qui propulsent le retour du Canada à l'International Catering Cup à Lyon.">Join the partners powering Canada's return to the International Catering Cup in Lyon.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/sponsor#inquiry" class="inline-block bg-gold text-ink px-8 py-4 font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-gold-light transition-colors duration-200 btn-cta" data-lang-en="Claim Your Spot" data-lang-fr="Réserver votre place">Claim Your Spot</a>
        <a href="/sponsor" class="inline-block border border-gold-dark text-gold-dark px-8 py-4 font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-gold-dark hover:text-cream transition-colors duration-200 btn-cta" data-lang-en="Explore Sponsorship" data-lang-fr="Découvrir le partenariat">Explore Sponsorship</a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-muted text-xs mt-4" data-lang-en="The partnership package arrives by email, free and with no obligation" data-lang-fr="Le dossier de partenariat arrive par courriel, gratuitement et sans engagement">The partnership package arrives by email, free and with no obligation</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<hr class="section-divider">
